Q: How to upsert in a mongodb nested object without losing existing unreferenced fields A: <p>I eventually came up with the following solution.</p>
<pre><code>//update = update.Set(x =&gt; x.Properties, issue.Properties)

foreach (var props in issue.Properties)
{
    update = update.Set(x =&gt; x.Properties[props.Key], props.Value);
}
</code></pre>
<p>I'd thought I needed to pull the issue and compare properties of that object and the update object line by line to do what I wanted but <code>Set</code> does the job.</p>
